WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
And the plant growth rate doubles after planting

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,420
Are you all so powerful?

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,380
The gift I received is 500 doses of Never Revealing Secrets

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,620
I remember the world record is only 224 kilograms

5
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,900
That’s four hundred and forty-eight doses.

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,140
This guy's talent for strange powers seems pretty good.

7
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,620
Specializing in weapons is not allowed in the community

8
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,620
Meet people later

9
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,660
You have to be careful, senior

10
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,060
Famine will officially come the day after tomorrow

11
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,100
It's a bit wasteful, it's okay

12
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,500
We already have meat

13
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:37,200
Tomorrow morning we are going to look for wild vegetables. We have already touched the boxes and in the afternoon we are going to cut down trees. Okay, then I'll go to sleep. Good night, senior. Don't worry, I still have the protector.
